SUMMARY:Kinusaiga Art
DESCRIPTION:This workshop invites mothers and children to explore the meaning of home through texture\, layering and memory. Using the contemporary fabric Japanese art of Kinusaiga\, participants will create a fabric piece by choosing materials that feel familiar and comforting. The experience celebrates how home is felt through touch\, emotion and personal expression.
LOCATION:Ithra - Ithra Tower - level 8\, Art Studio
